100.64.3.1   desktop-hsbf3et        linux   active; direct 192.168.1.0/24, tx 5842 rx 1234
[OK]   2 peers in mesh (us + gateway)

=== Step 2: Check Tailscale can reach gateway ===
$ sudo tailscale ping 100.64.0.1 -c 3
pong from lke505319-728018-... (100.64.0.1) via DERP(sfo) in 197ms
pong from lke505319-728018-... (100.64.0.1) via DERP(sfo) in 195ms
pong from lke505319-728018-... (100.64.0.1) via DERP(sfo) in 198ms
[OK]   3/3 pings successful

=== Step 3: Check sshd is listening on 100.64.3.1 ===
$ sudo ss -tlnp | grep :22
LISTEN 0 128 0.0.0.0:22 0.0.0.0:* users:(("sshd",pid=<PID>,fd=3))
